{{Quote|text=}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC and the leader of [[The First Slash Guild]]. She is known to be a fierce fighter, with [[Lance]] as her second-in-command.

Jolyne deeply values [[Fable Reef]] and her guildmates, treating them and the Player like family. A storyteller at heart, she writes books about her adventures.

{{TOC|limit=2}}

